c for correlated-k table
C KN is the number of gaussian points in the correlated-k table
C NL is the number of wavelength interval at the SR bands
C NT is the number of temperature grid points (150K,200K,250K,300K)
C NP is the number of pressure grid points (1 bar, 0.1 bar, 0.01 bar, 0.001 bar)

        PARAMETER(KNEW=4, NL=17, NP=5, NumT=4)

